<item><title>Turkey denies plans to send 15,000 troops to Somalia</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/turkey-denies-plans-to-send-15-000-troops-to-somalia-f2058e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/turkey-denies-plans-to-send-15-000-troops-to-somalia-f2058e/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>Ankara says its existing forces will keep to training and advisory work, after Uganda began pulling its own troops out of Somalia.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:28:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>US forces pull out of Baledogle airfield over runway safety</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/us-forces-pull-out-of-baledogle-airfield-over-runway-safety-1a4a79/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/us-forces-pull-out-of-baledogle-airfield-over-runway-safety-1a4a79/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>Resurfacing the deteriorating runway would have cost tens of millions of dollars, US Africa Command said.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:21:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/us-forces-pull-out-of-baledogle-airfield-over-runway-safety-1a4a79/share.jpg" length="40482" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/us-forces-pull-out-of-baledogle-airfield-over-runway-safety-1a4a79/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
